n exists. The fare line (EV-FARE-02729) charges SGD 4.50, reconciling with the platform policy figure, so no POL-NS-08(d) defect arises. The POL-NS-07 anti-farming check does not trip (no_show_terminations_30d = 1, below 4; 1 / 105 completed trips = 0.0095, below 0.08), so compensation is payable at 80 percent of SGD 4.50 = SGD 3.60. No escalation trigger under POL-NS-09 applies. The monetary effect (SGD 3.60) is below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold, so it executes automatically. Confidence 0.9 rests on the trip record and the GPS trace, each at weight 1.0, which independently carry the arrival and dwell findings."
